flowchart TD
  U[Player input + coding editor] --> M[Legacy mission/content adapter]
  M --> REQ[Execution request v1]
  REQ --> G[core.grade.grade subprocess]
  G --> W[worker.evaluate: isolated process]
  W --> RES[Result normalizer + schema check]
  RES --> Q{Contract type?}
  Q -- Existing mission --> L[Existing Game.collect / Expeditions.accept]
  Q -- New plan --> V[Parent revalidate snapshot, energy, capabilities, geometry]
  V -->|Rejected| ERR[UI diagnostic / bounded trace]
  V -->|Authorized| R[Fixed-tick Game-owned ProgramRuntime]
  R --> RED[WorldEventReducer + event idempotency]
  RED --> S[Atomic milestone + existing save]
  RED --> SNAP[Read-only render snapshot]
  SNAP --> DRAW[Pygame renderer]
  S --> REC[Resume/replay]
  style W fill:#eee,stroke:#333,color:#111
